[9.402675, "o", "\u001b[1;33m  ⚠  apiGroups/resources/verbs are all \"*\" — full cluster access if deployed!\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.404315, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m# Act 2 — OpenCode agent qualifies the upgrade offline (no cluster access)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.807231, "o", "$ opencode run --standalone --auto --model litellm/claude-sonnet-4-6 \\\r\n    --file skills/helm-preflight/SKILL.md \\\r\n    \"Qualify the Helm upgrade of webapp from rbac-escalation/baseline to candidate\"\r\n"]
[15.908536, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[16.323911, "o", "\u001b[0m→ \u001b[0mSkill \"OpenCode\" \r\n"]
[17.518522, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[20.725719, "o", "I'll follow the helm-preflight skill protocol exactly. Let me start by examining the charts and then run the preflight binary.\r\n"]
[20.739032, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mls /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/baseline && echo \"---\" && ls /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate\r\nChart.yaml\r\ntemplates\r\n---\r\nChart.yaml\r\ntemplates\r\n"]
[20.741853, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mls /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/policies/rego && ls /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/bin/\r\nhooks.rego\r\nrbac.rego\r\nworkloads.rego\r\nconftest\r\npreflight\r\npreflight-linux-amd64\r\n"]
[22.245849, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[24.895903, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mchmod +x /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/bin/preflight-linux-amd64\r\n\r\n/home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/bin/preflight-linux-amd64 upgrade \\\r\n  --from /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/baseline \\\r\n  --to   /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate \\\r\n  --release-name webapp \\\r\n  --namespace staging \\\r\n  --kube-version 1.37 \\\r\n  --policy-dir /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/policies/rego \\\r\n  --output-file /tmp/preflight-agent-report.json\r\n\r\necho \"EXIT CODE: $?\"\r\nEXIT CODE: 2\r\n"]
[26.174258, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[27.181847, "o", "Exit code `2` → **BLOCK**. Now reading the report:\r\n"]
[27.189177, "o", "\u001b[0m→ \u001b[0mRead /tmp/preflight-agent-report.json \r\n"]
[28.47769, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[31.731749, "o", "Now let me look at the candidate chart to propose the minimal fix:\r\n"]
[31.741221, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcat /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/baseline/templates/*.yaml 2>/dev/null || find /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/baseline/templates -type f -exec cat {} \\;\r\napiVersion: apps/v1\r\nkind: Deployment\r\nmetadata:\r\n  name: {{ .Release.Name }}-nginx\r\n  namespace: {{ .Release.Namespace }}\r\n  labels:\r\n    app: nginx\r\nspec:\r\n  replicas: 1\r\n  selector:\r\n    matchLabels:\r\n      app: nginx\r\n  template:\r\n    metadata:\r\n      labels:\r\n        app: nginx\r\n    spec:\r\n      containers:\r\n        - name: nginx\r\n          image: nginx:1.25.0\r\n          ports:\r\n            - containerPort: 80\r\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\r\nkind: ClusterRole\r\nmetadata:\r\n  name: {{ .Release.Name }}-reader\r\nrules:\r\n  - apiGroups: [\"\"]\r\n    resources: [\"pods\", \"services\"]\r\n    verbs: [\"get\", \"list\", \"watch\"]\r\n"]
[31.745592, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mfind /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates -type f | xargs ls -la && echo \"---\" && cat /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates/*.yaml 2>/dev/null || find /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates -type f -exec cat {} \\;\r\n-rw-r--r--. 1 vpcuser vpcuser 398 Nov 13 17:42 /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates/deployment.yaml\r\n-rw-r--r--. 1 vpcuser vpcuser 170 Nov 12 21:59 /home/vpcuser/helm-agent-preflight/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates/rbac.yaml\r\n---\r\napiVersion: apps/v1\r\nkind: Deployment\r\nmetadata:\r\n  name: {{ .Release.Name }}-nginx\r\n  namespace: {{ .Release.Namespace }}\r\n  labels:\r\n    app: nginx\r\nspec:\r\n  replicas: 1\r\n  selector:\r\n    matchLabels:\r\n      app: nginx\r\n  template:\r\n    metadata:\r\n      labels:\r\n        app: nginx\r\n    spec:\r\n      containers:\r\n        - name: nginx\r\n          image: nginx:1.25.0\r\n          ports:\r\n            - containerPort: 80\r\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\r\nkind: ClusterRole\r\nmetadata:\r\n  name: {{ .Release.Name }}-reader\r\nrules:\r\n  - apiGroups: [\"*\"]\r\n    resources: [\"*\"]\r\n    verbs: [\"*\"]\r\n"]
[32.988559, "o", "> build · claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n"]
[49.010583, "o", "I have everything I need. Here is the complete preflight report:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 🔴 Preflight Verdict: BLOCK — upgrade must NOT proceed\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Run Metadata\r\n\r\n| Field | Value |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| **Verdict** | `BLOCK` |\r\n| **Fingerprint** | `dfa717c9defb04f4` (first 16 chars) |\r\n| **Tool** | helm-agent-preflight `v0.1.0-dev` |\r\n| **No deployment occurred** | ✅ `true` — confirmed |\r\n| **Rendering stability** | ✅ `stability_confirmed: true` |\r\n| **Evidence completeness** | ✅ `COMPLETE` — no limitations |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Security Findings (2 — both CRITICAL, both NEW)\r\n\r\n| # | Rule ID | Severity | Kind / Name | JSON Path | Message | Pre-existing? |\r\n|---|---------|----------|-------------|-----------|---------|---------------|\r\n| 1 | **RBAC-001** | 🔴 CRITICAL | `ClusterRole/webapp-reader` | `$.rules[0].resources` | Wildcard `*` in resources grants access to **all resource types** | `false` (new) |\r\n| 2 | **RBAC-002** | 🔴 CRITICAL | `ClusterRole/webapp-reader` | `$.rules[0].verbs` | Wildcard `*` in verbs grants **all operations** | `false` (new) |\r\n\r\nBoth findings have `verdict_contribution: BLOCK` and are **introduced by the candidate** — they did not exist in the baseline.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Diff Summary\r\n\r\n| Added | Modified | Removed |\r\n|-------|----------|---------|\r\n| 0 | **1** | 0 |\r\n\r\n**Modified resource:** `ClusterRole/webapp-reader`\r\n\r\nThe candidate's `rules` changed from explicit, least-privilege grants to full wildcards:\r\n\r\n| Field | Baseline | Candidate |\r\n|-------|----------|-----------|\r\n| `apiGroups` | `[\"\"]` | `[\"*\"]` |\r\n| `resources` | `[\"pods\", \"services\"]` | `[\"*\"]` |\r\n| `verbs` | `[\"get\", \"list\", \"watch\"]` | `[\"*\"]` |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### ✅ No Deployment Occurred\r\n\r\nConfirmed via both `operation.no_deployment_occurred: true` and `run_metadata.no_deployment_occurred: true`. This was a fully offline qualification — no cluster credentials were used.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Proposed Fix\r\n\r\nThe candidate's `rbac.yaml` introduced wildcards that grant unrestricted cluster-wide access. The **minimal fix** is to restore the explicit, least-privilege rules from the baseline:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n--- a/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates/rbac.yaml\r\n+++ b/examples/rbac-escalation/candidate/templates/rbac.yaml\r\n@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ metadata:\r\n   name: {{ .Release.Name }}-reader\r\n rules:\r\n-  - apiGroups: [\"*\"]\r\n-    resources: [\"*\"]\r\n-    verbs: [\"*\"]\r\n+  - apiGroups: [\"\"]\r\n+    resources: [\"pods\", \"services\"]\r\n+    verbs: [\"get\", \"list\", \"watch\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**What this does:**\r\n- **RBAC-001 fix:** Replaces `resources: [\"*\"]` with the specific resource types the app actually needs (`pods`, `services`)\r\n- **RBAC-002 fix:** Replaces `verbs: [\"*\"]` with read-only operations (`get`, `list`, `watch`)\r\n- **apiGroups** is also corrected from `\"*\"` (all API groups) back to `\"\"` (core API group only)\r\n\r\n> ⚠️ **Human authorization required** before modifying any project files. If you approve, I can apply this change and re-run preflight to confirm a PASS verdict.\r\n"]
